WEBVTT

00:00:01.320 --> 00:00:03.770
Things have settled down, but...

00:00:11.610 --> 00:00:14.860
We still haven't resolved 
the problem at its root.

00:00:15.140 --> 00:00:17.680
We haven't responded to the 
request for romantic advice,

00:00:17.680 --> 00:00:20.050
and the future of the newspaper 
association is still uncertain.

00:00:20.050 --> 00:00:23.780
That's all true, but there's 
a much more pressing issue.

00:00:24.870 --> 00:00:27.400
The disguise you'll wear on dates!

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:28.460
What?!

00:00:31.210 --> 00:00:32.540
That's right!

00:00:32.740 --> 00:00:34.860
It's a race against time!

00:00:35.350 --> 00:00:36.710
Urgent action needed!

00:00:37.130 --> 00:00:40.550
You can't go on dates in peace 
if you don't disguise yourself.

00:00:41.810 --> 00:00:42.820
Wait!

00:00:42.820 --> 00:00:45.280
The next time I see him will be 
my coming-of-age ceremony!

00:00:45.280 --> 00:00:46.850
Is he a time capsule?

00:00:47.100 --> 00:00:51.270
This recent incident caused a lot 
of trouble, and Suzu worked so hard.

00:00:51.270 --> 00:00:55.850
The teachers were really scary, 
but Suzu was so courageous.

00:00:56.230 --> 00:01:00.180
I even crossdressed against 
my will. It was agony.

00:01:00.180 --> 00:01:01.580
Liar!

00:01:01.860 --> 00:01:03.000
Fine, I get it.

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:04.490
You can make it your research topic.

00:01:04.760 --> 00:01:06.960
But this means we're even, okay?

00:01:13.420 --> 00:01:14.970
Take off your glasses!

00:01:14.970 --> 00:01:16.790
Try letting your hair down!

00:01:16.790 --> 00:01:20.010
Stop!

00:02:54.110 --> 00:02:56.320
So the glasses are actually the main body?!

00:02:56.320 --> 00:02:57.070
What?

00:02:57.070 --> 00:02:59.240
She's like a different 
person without her glasses.

00:02:57.670 --> 00:03:01.980
<b>The Elite Student Council (Photos)</b>

00:02:59.470 --> 00:03:02.600
The prescription is so strong.

00:03:04.070 --> 00:03:06.330
Damn... I can't see.

00:03:06.880 --> 00:03:08.030
Give them back.

00:03:08.330 --> 00:03:09.570
Where are they?

00:03:09.570 --> 00:03:12.860
Senpai is just like a newborn fawn.

00:03:12.860 --> 00:03:14.540
The contrast makes my heart pound!

00:03:14.910 --> 00:03:16.630
C-Can't see...

00:03:17.370 --> 00:03:19.760
My glasses... my glasses...

00:03:21.610 --> 00:03:22.950
What are you doing?

00:03:22.950 --> 00:03:23.950
Are you all right?

00:03:23.950 --> 00:03:25.260
She's secretly a klutz?

00:03:26.720 --> 00:03:29.200
Just how many heroine attributes do you have?

00:03:29.200 --> 00:03:29.900
It's not fair!

00:03:29.900 --> 00:03:31.170
Shut up!

00:03:32.440 --> 00:03:35.800
If I look that different, I don't need 
any more of a disguise than this.

00:03:35.960 --> 00:03:37.230
What are you talking about?

00:03:37.230 --> 00:03:39.460
There's no point if we don't make you cute.

00:03:39.000 --> 00:03:41.620
It's like I'm in another world.

00:03:39.460 --> 00:03:41.620
In any case, give me back my glasses!

00:03:41.620 --> 00:03:42.730
I can't see anything!

00:03:42.730 --> 00:03:44.240
Here you are.

00:03:42.730 --> 00:03:44.240
Are you okay?

00:03:47.480 --> 00:03:51.680
From my brother's unusual glasses 
collection, the "Heart Lovely Max!"

00:03:51.820 --> 00:03:53.550
It's a present for you.

00:03:53.550 --> 00:03:56.150
Will you introduce me to 
your brother sometime?

00:03:59.170 --> 00:04:01.530
I investigated the location of your date, and—

00:04:01.530 --> 00:04:02.930
Don't use it as your wallpaper!

00:04:02.930 --> 00:04:05.080
What kind of lame clothes are these?

00:04:05.080 --> 00:04:06.630
When did you buy them?

00:04:06.630 --> 00:04:07.520
Three years ago.

00:04:07.520 --> 00:04:09.350
In elementary school?

00:04:09.590 --> 00:04:10.650
My cousin gave them to me.

00:04:10.650 --> 00:04:12.300
You didn't even buy them!

00:04:12.300 --> 00:04:14.840
And her cousin's a boy.

00:04:15.200 --> 00:04:18.340
You wore clothes from another man 
on your first date in six months.

00:04:18.340 --> 00:04:20.110
Just how terrible are you?

00:04:20.290 --> 00:04:23.400
S-Simple is better...

00:04:23.400 --> 00:04:25.410
You just don't want to dress up!

00:04:25.740 --> 00:04:27.530
You are, indeed, a terrible girl.

00:04:27.530 --> 00:04:28.500
Huh?

00:04:28.500 --> 00:04:31.040
Riko, this is all calculated.

00:04:31.320 --> 00:04:35.050
Without pants, that top would instantly 
bring a thrill to any boy's heart.

00:04:35.240 --> 00:04:37.220
"Baggy boys' clothes"!

00:04:37.220 --> 00:04:38.790
<b>Stretch</b>

00:04:37.220 --> 00:04:38.790
What am I, a flasher?!

00:04:39.140 --> 00:04:40.640
In order to avoid suspicion,

00:04:40.640 --> 00:04:43.390
you can spill juice on your clothes
 as an excuse to remove them.

00:04:43.790 --> 00:04:46.050
H-How erotic!

00:04:46.350 --> 00:04:49.180
Ero-shima, Ero-shima.

00:04:49.180 --> 00:04:50.430
No one's stripping!

00:04:50.430 --> 00:04:53.230
At least show some leg.

00:04:53.230 --> 00:04:54.120
Come on.

00:04:54.120 --> 00:04:56.480
We've got a dirty old man over here.

00:04:56.760 --> 00:04:59.740
What about at least wearing a short skirt?

00:04:59.890 --> 00:05:02.690
The only skirt I have is my school uniform.

00:05:02.880 --> 00:05:04.990
There's something good in here.

00:05:07.280 --> 00:05:08.880
Costumes, costumes!

00:05:10.780 --> 00:05:12.790
Which era is your favorite?

00:05:13.790 --> 00:05:14.970
"Era"?

00:05:16.890 --> 00:05:21.120
<b>Cave Person</b>

00:05:17.910 --> 00:05:19.460
Even the Wild Kid's face will turn pale.

00:05:19.460 --> 00:05:21.130
Don't use that name!

00:05:22.030 --> 00:05:25.160
<b>Ninja</b>

00:05:22.890 --> 00:05:25.170
My specialties are ninja techniques of love.

00:05:26.030 --> 00:05:29.210
<b>Form-fitting</b>

00:05:26.920 --> 00:05:29.220
A sweet, dangerous taste of the '80s.

00:05:30.930 --> 00:05:34.500
Hey. You didn't buy these with 
the council's budget, did you?

00:05:34.500 --> 00:05:35.230
Gulp!

00:05:37.780 --> 00:05:40.750
I'm waiting for you, 
my prince on a white horse.

00:05:38.790 --> 00:05:44.220
<b>Middle Ages</b>

00:05:41.600 --> 00:05:44.230
<i>If anyone saw me like this, I'd cry.</i>

00:05:50.970 --> 00:05:53.400
Hey, wait!

00:05:54.770 --> 00:05:57.740
Tell Me, Nii-sama!

00:05:55.960 --> 00:05:57.750
Tell me, Nii-sama!

00:05:59.630 --> 00:06:01.990
Why did you do a ponytail, not a bun?

00:06:01.990 --> 00:06:02.910
What?

00:06:02.910 --> 00:06:05.560
This says buns are better.

00:06:05.790 --> 00:06:07.760
W-Well, because...

00:06:10.720 --> 00:06:15.560
"High buns are best for showing 
off the back of your neck."

00:06:18.060 --> 00:06:20.760
If you're going to show off 
your neck, do a ponytail!

00:06:20.760 --> 00:06:23.710
Either that, or pigtails!

00:06:24.250 --> 00:06:26.280
...is what my brother told me.

00:06:26.660 --> 00:06:28.960
Tell him to hurry up and find a job.

00:06:28.960 --> 00:06:31.400
Also, the next time I see him, I'll strangle him.

00:06:32.220 --> 00:06:33.500
Love Lab!

00:06:35.910 --> 00:06:40.850
<i>Hello. I'm Mizushima's 
b-boyfriend, Yamazaki Yuu.</i>

00:06:41.600 --> 00:06:43.080
<i>I know this is sudden,</i>

00:06:43.080 --> 00:06:47.160
<i>but I'd like to tell you the 
story of how Mizushima and I met.</i>

00:06:45.360 --> 00:06:47.750
Mizushima
Sayori

00:06:47.990 --> 00:06:50.720
My name is Mizushima. 
Nice to meet you.

00:06:51.140 --> 00:06:52.390
Your seat is over there.

00:06:53.680 --> 00:06:55.400
<i>She's sitting next to me?</i>

00:06:55.400 --> 00:06:57.800
Yamazaki-kun, show her your textbook.

00:06:57.800 --> 00:06:58.640
What?

00:06:58.910 --> 00:07:00.520
<i>This sucks.</i>

00:07:05.460 --> 00:07:07.400
<i>What weird glasses.</i>

00:07:08.670 --> 00:07:10.650
Mizushima-san, you came from Fuji Girls'?

00:07:10.650 --> 00:07:12.990
That's amazing. What was it like?

00:07:12.990 --> 00:07:15.700
Is that skirt part of your uniform?

00:07:15.850 --> 00:07:17.560
<i>Girls are such posers.</i>

00:07:17.560 --> 00:07:19.160
<i>They jump on every little fad.</i>

00:07:20.660 --> 00:07:22.170
<i>After a while...</i>

00:07:22.670 --> 00:07:26.840
Why did you quit Fuji Girls' if you liked it 
so much you wear the uniform every day?

00:07:26.840 --> 00:07:29.810
And out of season, too.

00:07:30.020 --> 00:07:31.130
<i>Jealousy.</i>

00:07:31.510 --> 00:07:33.800
Because we basically ran away.

00:07:35.110 --> 00:07:38.020
Besides, it's not as though I like Fuji Girls'.

00:07:38.440 --> 00:07:40.460
This uniform's durable and 
I have a lot of spares,

00:07:40.460 --> 00:07:41.910
so it'd be dumb not to use them.

00:07:43.820 --> 00:07:45.440
I-I see.

00:07:45.440 --> 00:07:46.580
Sounds like a rough time.

00:07:46.580 --> 00:07:48.040
Sorry.

00:07:50.260 --> 00:07:52.580
<i>Wh-What a weird girl.</i>

00:07:55.000 --> 00:07:55.820
What?

00:07:57.240 --> 00:07:59.250
W-Was that true?

00:07:59.250 --> 00:08:00.280
Yeah.

00:08:00.280 --> 00:08:01.840
Wouldn't you hide that, normally?

00:08:01.840 --> 00:08:04.880
Hiding things just causes more trouble later.

00:08:06.420 --> 00:08:07.700
<i>She's genuine.</i>

00:08:09.960 --> 00:08:12.590
<i>Even though she shook off the girls...</i>

00:08:13.130 --> 00:08:14.720
Mizushima.

00:08:15.340 --> 00:08:17.440
I heard your family skipped town.

00:08:17.440 --> 00:08:19.300
And you've worn that dress this whole time?

00:08:19.300 --> 00:08:21.700
Are you so small because 
you can't afford to eat?

00:08:24.320 --> 00:08:25.690
<i>I knew it.</i>

00:08:27.150 --> 00:08:30.120
My parents worked hard, but they 
can't help how things turned out.

00:08:30.120 --> 00:08:32.280
It's not my fault, either.

00:08:32.490 --> 00:08:34.640
Are your imaginations that puny?

00:08:34.640 --> 00:08:36.780
Your hearts must be pretty small.

00:08:37.010 --> 00:08:38.280
Your brains, too.

00:08:38.540 --> 00:08:41.000
Maybe I should make the most 
of my family's weakness,

00:08:41.230 --> 00:08:45.040
and have a lengthy talk with 
your teachers and parents,

00:08:45.180 --> 00:08:46.620
you midgets.

00:08:46.620 --> 00:08:48.500
Sorry.

00:08:50.520 --> 00:08:52.970
<i>A-Amazing.</i>

00:08:54.480 --> 00:08:59.720
<i>Shortly afterwards, we changed 
seats and I lost contact with her.</i>

00:09:00.210 --> 00:09:03.780
<i>Actually, no one had any 
contact with Mizushima.</i>

00:09:04.190 --> 00:09:06.140
<i>It wasn't out of false pride or anything.</i>

00:09:06.400 --> 00:09:08.730
<i>She was just always by herself.</i>

00:09:09.080 --> 00:09:11.730
Mizushima's small, but she's got a big attitude.

00:09:11.960 --> 00:09:13.980
It's not like she's loud, though.

00:09:14.170 --> 00:09:16.280
She's always expressionless, too.

00:09:19.170 --> 00:09:21.810
I can't tell what she's thinking.

00:09:22.040 --> 00:09:23.400
<i>They're absolutely right.</i>

00:09:23.550 --> 00:09:24.940
<i>She's a weird girl.</i>

00:09:25.880 --> 00:09:28.880
<i>But, that small body</i>

00:09:29.140 --> 00:09:32.160
<i>seemed big to me sometimes.</i>

00:09:32.800 --> 00:09:34.910
Floor scrubbing race!

00:09:34.910 --> 00:09:36.300
Ready...

00:09:36.800 --> 00:09:37.800
Start!

00:09:40.020 --> 00:09:42.010
<i>I'm off to a good start!</i>

00:09:42.910 --> 00:09:44.640
<i>If I keep up this pace, I'll win!</i>

00:09:47.160 --> 00:09:49.080
Hey, Yamazaki! In front of you!

00:09:49.080 --> 00:09:49.770
Huh?

00:10:05.570 --> 00:10:08.920
<i>I've never seen her make that face before.</i>

00:10:14.940 --> 00:10:18.880
<i>The next day, all the girls in the 
class gave me the cold shoulder.</i>

00:10:18.900 --> 00:10:25.380
<u>Contract</u>
To cover her medical expenses,
 I will give Mizushima Sayori
my snacks until we change classes.
Yamazaki Yuu

00:10:22.440 --> 00:10:24.840
<i>Goodbye, my allowance.</i>

00:10:27.220 --> 00:10:28.640
This starts today.

00:10:32.260 --> 00:10:33.820
That was unlucky.

00:10:33.820 --> 00:10:35.800
What you did was terrible, though.

00:10:35.800 --> 00:10:38.240
It doesn't actually bother Mizushima at all.

00:10:38.680 --> 00:10:41.310
She was expressionless when 
she was hitting you, too.

00:10:42.680 --> 00:10:46.160
Did I mistake her expression, then?

00:10:46.500 --> 00:10:48.460
She wasn't fazed at all.

00:10:48.460 --> 00:10:50.170
She's totally not a girl.

00:10:57.060 --> 00:11:00.350
Don't you think Mizushima's kind of cute?

00:11:00.350 --> 00:11:01.370
What?

00:11:01.680 --> 00:11:03.890
Is your head okay?

00:11:04.500 --> 00:11:07.580
This is the first time I've seen her in pants.

00:11:08.650 --> 00:11:10.780
<i>And that brings us to the present.</i>

00:11:11.300 --> 00:11:16.220
<i>If there's one thing I want now, it's 
to see Mizushima a little more often.</i>

00:11:16.820 --> 00:11:19.350
<i>This has been Mizushima's boyfriend, Yuu.</i>

00:11:19.920 --> 00:11:22.910
Tell Me, Nii-sama!

00:11:20.950 --> 00:11:22.910
Tell me, Nii-sama!

00:11:23.710 --> 00:11:26.060
Suzu, can you make me a slapstick?

00:11:26.060 --> 00:11:27.760
I'm going to Eno's place today.

00:11:27.760 --> 00:11:28.560
What?

00:11:28.560 --> 00:11:30.960
Give it as much destructive power as you can!

00:11:30.960 --> 00:11:31.840
What?!

00:11:33.840 --> 00:11:34.790
It's Sayori!

00:11:35.070 --> 00:11:37.090
Go home! Don't open your mouth!

00:11:37.090 --> 00:11:39.510
Stop making me face reality!

00:11:40.930 --> 00:11:43.040
I'm not as much of a 
masochist as your boyfriend!

00:11:43.040 --> 00:11:44.640
I'm easily wounded!

00:11:45.800 --> 00:11:47.780
You actually started dating after

00:11:47.780 --> 00:11:50.360
you beat him for diving under 
your skirt and blackmailed him?!

00:11:50.360 --> 00:11:52.440
That's too much of a reward!

00:11:52.440 --> 00:11:54.020
I'm not jealous at all, okay?!

00:11:54.300 --> 00:11:57.440
But looking up a girl's skirt 
is every guy's dream!

00:11:59.540 --> 00:12:00.920
So hardcore.

00:12:00.920 --> 00:12:02.490
Nii-sama!

00:12:02.490 --> 00:12:04.700
At least use your slapstick!

00:12:04.700 --> 00:12:07.620
I couldn't bear to waste time getting it out.

00:12:07.900 --> 00:12:10.830
Don't you think you should be harder on him?

00:12:10.830 --> 00:12:16.040
But, my brother took care 
of me when I was little.

00:12:16.260 --> 00:12:18.040
Though he teased me some, too...

00:12:19.020 --> 00:12:21.130
Yuiko's defending me!

00:12:21.130 --> 00:12:22.130
Thank you!

00:12:22.560 --> 00:12:26.220
At this rate, you might end up 
taking care of him in the future.

00:12:26.410 --> 00:12:30.560
Once he's done finding himself, I'm sure...

00:12:30.910 --> 00:12:34.270
I-Is this what it means to be 
attracted to your little sister?

00:12:34.600 --> 00:12:35.520
I'm so happy!

00:12:35.730 --> 00:12:39.960
It looks like he's finding a part of 
himself he'd be better off not finding.

00:12:40.630 --> 00:12:42.540
One more, s'il vous plaît.

00:12:44.470 --> 00:12:47.460
Wow, it's so cute.

00:12:47.460 --> 00:12:49.330
So cute!

00:12:50.590 --> 00:12:51.910
What are those pictures of?

00:12:51.910 --> 00:12:53.770
Remember when we gathered photographs

00:12:53.770 --> 00:12:57.060
with a "Sibling Memories" theme 
for the Fuji Girls' spring event?

00:12:57.520 --> 00:12:59.380
Suzu's came back.

00:12:59.380 --> 00:13:01.590
Sayo-senpai, that's my big brother.

00:13:01.590 --> 00:13:03.860
You said you wanted to meet him.

00:13:03.860 --> 00:13:06.700
I just wanted to thank him 
for the weird glasses.

00:13:07.030 --> 00:13:09.710
So, why are you wearing dog ears?

00:13:09.710 --> 00:13:15.390
Oh, I loved the dog bus from 
"My Neighbor Tororo-san" back then.

00:13:28.050 --> 00:13:30.560
The dog bus is so cute.

00:13:32.100 --> 00:13:33.610
<b>My Neighbor 
Tororo-san
</b>Remastered Version

00:13:32.600 --> 00:13:36.890
Hey, Nii, will I be able to 
ride the dog bus someday?

00:13:37.120 --> 00:13:40.840
Oh, I'm sure you will as long 
as you're a good girl.

00:13:41.100 --> 00:13:42.630
Am I a bad girl?

00:13:42.630 --> 00:13:43.990
You're a super good girl.

00:13:43.990 --> 00:13:45.050
It'll come for you soon.

00:13:46.870 --> 00:13:48.340
Maybe that's the dog bus.

00:13:51.520 --> 00:13:54.020
Suzu, I'm home.

00:13:54.020 --> 00:13:56.060
Did you come to greet me?

00:13:57.620 --> 00:13:59.910
Oh, Nee.

00:14:00.190 --> 00:14:01.480
Welcome home.

00:14:01.730 --> 00:14:02.570
Huh?

00:14:02.940 --> 00:14:04.260
This is your fault!

00:14:04.260 --> 00:14:07.680
Do you understand what it's like 
to be greeted with disappointment?!

00:14:07.680 --> 00:14:10.260
What? That was my fault?

00:14:10.260 --> 00:14:11.160
Yes!

00:14:11.460 --> 00:14:12.860
Here's your evening paper.

00:14:13.630 --> 00:14:15.870
What are you going to do?! 
She took you seriously!

00:14:15.870 --> 00:14:17.660
Yeah, but...

00:14:18.920 --> 00:14:20.630
Oh, for crying out loud!

00:14:20.880 --> 00:14:22.220
Delivery for you.

00:14:23.130 --> 00:14:25.850
It's your fault for saying it would come soon.

00:14:25.850 --> 00:14:28.380
She was so cute, I couldn't help myself.

00:14:28.680 --> 00:14:30.060
Here's your milk.

00:14:34.840 --> 00:14:37.520
Was I a bad girl?

00:14:39.970 --> 00:14:42.170
N-No, it's just...

00:14:42.170 --> 00:14:44.660
The dog bus seems to be pretty busy.

00:14:44.660 --> 00:14:47.150
That's right. It's breeding 
season for the dog bus.

00:14:47.150 --> 00:14:49.150
No!

00:14:49.150 --> 00:14:50.490
In that case...

00:14:53.100 --> 00:14:57.980
<b>Dog Bus</b>

00:14:53.100 --> 00:14:59.320
Tororo-san Measure

00:14:53.100 --> 00:14:59.320
Commissioned
 Business

00:14:53.180 --> 00:14:56.220
The dog bus asked me to do him a favor.

00:14:56.140 --> 00:14:59.320
<b>Here</b>

00:14:56.220 --> 00:14:59.330
Come on. All aboard the brother bus!

00:14:58.020 --> 00:14:59.320
<b>Brother Bus</b>

00:15:00.680 --> 00:15:02.340
"Brother bus"?

00:15:02.720 --> 00:15:04.090
You can't possibly be serious...

00:15:05.960 --> 00:15:07.480
She's loving it?!

00:15:07.480 --> 00:15:10.600
I'm the brother bus! What do you think, Suzu?

00:15:09.150 --> 00:15:10.600
This is stupid.

00:15:10.600 --> 00:15:12.480
You're amazing, Nii!

00:15:12.480 --> 00:15:14.320
We're making a U-turn.

00:15:14.650 --> 00:15:15.970
I love you, Nii.

00:15:17.850 --> 00:15:19.020
Sister bus!

00:15:17.870 --> 00:15:21.470
<b>Sister Bus
(Privately 
Operated)</b>

00:15:20.490 --> 00:15:21.480
A rival company?!

00:15:23.050 --> 00:15:24.310
You can't steal my idea!

00:15:24.580 --> 00:15:25.700
I'm not stealing!

00:15:25.700 --> 00:15:26.690
I'm carrying her on my back!

00:15:26.920 --> 00:15:28.240
And I smell good!

00:15:28.240 --> 00:15:29.440
What's that supposed to mean?

00:15:29.670 --> 00:15:31.490
Suzu's already made her reservation!

00:15:30.270 --> 00:15:32.660
Nii, Nee.

00:15:31.490 --> 00:15:32.660
She'll have to cancel, then!

00:15:32.660 --> 00:15:33.850
What about my cancellation fee?

00:15:33.170 --> 00:15:36.830
Don't fight. Stop!

00:15:33.850 --> 00:15:35.030
I'll definitely be cancelling that.

00:15:35.030 --> 00:15:37.560
What are you talking about? That makes no sense!

00:15:40.700 --> 00:15:44.030
<b>Brother Sister Bus</b>

00:15:40.700 --> 00:15:44.030
(Business Partnership)

00:15:41.020 --> 00:15:42.400
Business partnership!

00:15:42.400 --> 00:15:44.040
Brother sister bus!

00:15:47.980 --> 00:15:50.510
This is a picture of that moment.

00:15:50.510 --> 00:15:51.840
They're crazy for Suzu.

00:15:51.840 --> 00:15:54.900
Your brother's weird, but he's nice.

00:15:54.900 --> 00:15:56.170
So is your sister.

00:15:56.170 --> 00:15:59.490
Eno, didn't you get your pictures back, too?

00:16:01.850 --> 00:16:03.850
I'm going home early.

00:16:04.250 --> 00:16:05.980
It's inside her bag!

00:16:07.280 --> 00:16:08.610
Let us see!

00:16:09.540 --> 00:16:12.450
Hey, stop!

00:16:18.680 --> 00:16:19.640
Don't worry.

00:16:19.640 --> 00:16:22.330
Ask me for my story too!

00:16:22.350 --> 00:16:25.330
Tell Me, Nii-sama!

00:16:23.600 --> 00:16:25.330
Tell me, Nii-sama!

00:16:25.330 --> 00:16:28.400
Why did you tease me so 
much when I was little?!

00:16:28.400 --> 00:16:30.610
Everyone tried to comfort me for this!

00:16:30.790 --> 00:16:32.130
Photos from back then?

00:16:32.390 --> 00:16:34.500
I'm sorry, Yuiko.

00:16:35.210 --> 00:16:38.930
There was a lot going on back then.

00:16:39.150 --> 00:16:40.100
What?

00:16:40.310 --> 00:16:42.160
At the time...

00:16:42.980 --> 00:16:45.520
I thought sadistic egoists were popular.

00:16:47.530 --> 00:16:49.980
You know, the indiscretions of youth.

00:16:50.190 --> 00:16:51.690
I didn't realize what I was doing.

00:16:53.330 --> 00:16:56.240
No matter how you look at it, 
I was always a masochist!

00:16:57.820 --> 00:17:01.980
If I could go back now, 
I'd be <i>so</i> nice to you!

00:16:57.850 --> 00:17:02.060
<b>Masochist</b>

00:17:01.980 --> 00:17:03.580
Not so much nice as...

00:17:03.580 --> 00:17:05.790
Begging you to make me your servant!

00:17:12.920 --> 00:17:16.100
I think my brother might have problems.

00:17:16.100 --> 00:17:17.800
You're saying this <i>now</i>?

00:17:18.050 --> 00:17:19.290
Love Lab!

00:17:31.710 --> 00:17:34.990
Why did you trip when 
there's nothing there?

00:17:34.990 --> 00:17:36.600
Sayo-senpai.

00:17:37.610 --> 00:17:39.240
Thank you.

00:17:39.440 --> 00:17:41.550
You're as clumsy as ever today.

00:17:41.550 --> 00:17:43.080
I'm impressed.

00:17:43.080 --> 00:17:45.640
I'm trying to fix it, 
but it's not going well...

00:17:46.500 --> 00:17:49.580
<i>She's always so calm and cool.</i>

00:17:50.710 --> 00:17:52.450
Why don't you create a penalty?

00:17:52.750 --> 00:17:55.200
Pay me a thousand yen for every blunder.

00:17:55.200 --> 00:17:57.430
My allowance wouldn't even last a day!

00:17:58.120 --> 00:18:02.460
How about you give me a flick on 
the forehead for every blunder?

00:18:02.650 --> 00:18:03.710
Me?

00:18:03.710 --> 00:18:05.100
Okay, I'll do my—

00:18:09.080 --> 00:18:13.970
<b>Danger</b>

00:18:11.710 --> 00:18:13.280
This isn't easy.

00:18:14.320 --> 00:18:15.540
I'll do it, though.

00:18:17.300 --> 00:18:19.680
You're merciless.

00:18:24.790 --> 00:18:27.770
<i>It's a hard road to 
becoming a strong person.</i>

00:18:27.880 --> 00:18:29.400
Hey, look.

00:18:31.470 --> 00:18:33.380
It's the president.

00:18:33.660 --> 00:18:35.160
She's beautiful.

00:18:35.780 --> 00:18:40.180
<i>Maki-senpai is the subject of 
everyone's admiration again today.</i>

00:18:41.420 --> 00:18:42.720
Oh, Suzu.

00:18:42.720 --> 00:18:44.100
Moving to your next classroom?

00:18:47.020 --> 00:18:49.350
<i>She's so bright!</i>

00:18:49.580 --> 00:18:53.120
<i>I almost can't believe she talks to me.</i>

00:18:53.530 --> 00:18:54.320
Oh?

00:18:59.950 --> 00:19:01.940
It's red and swollen.

00:19:02.140 --> 00:19:03.160
It must hurt.

00:19:03.460 --> 00:19:05.920
<i>Sh-She's so close.</i>

00:19:06.700 --> 00:19:08.500
<i>She's too bright.</i>

00:19:08.920 --> 00:19:10.710
Hang on a second.

00:19:10.950 --> 00:19:12.750
I have a simple first aid kit.

00:19:13.060 --> 00:19:16.130
<i>That's way beyond a simple pocket first aid kit!</i>

00:19:17.900 --> 00:19:19.370
There, all done.

00:19:21.210 --> 00:19:22.720
See you after school.

00:19:23.460 --> 00:19:25.400
Thank you.

00:19:28.060 --> 00:19:29.920
That's Princess Fuji for you.

00:19:29.920 --> 00:19:32.270
She's always prepared to help other students.

00:19:32.590 --> 00:19:37.190
<i>No, it's probably so she'll never miss 
a chance to meet a potential boyfriend.</i>

00:19:37.630 --> 00:19:42.490
<i>They don't know how cute President 
Maki is behind closed doors.</i>

00:19:42.730 --> 00:19:45.650
<i>Only the student council knows her secret.</i>

00:19:46.300 --> 00:19:49.250
<i>It makes me feel a little special.</i>

00:19:50.330 --> 00:19:51.940
Hey, you guys.

00:19:52.710 --> 00:19:54.580
Don't slack off. Get back to cleaning.

00:19:55.050 --> 00:19:56.590
<i>It's Eno-senpai.</i>

00:19:56.860 --> 00:19:59.300
<i>She has a strong sense of justice,</i>

00:19:59.300 --> 00:20:02.430
<i>but people misunderstand her 
because she can act harsh at times.</i>

00:20:02.430 --> 00:20:03.800
Are you listening?

00:20:04.960 --> 00:20:07.120
Sorry.

00:20:07.120 --> 00:20:09.760
I don't believe this. Come on, hurry up.

00:20:09.760 --> 00:20:10.360
Huh?

00:20:10.360 --> 00:20:11.230
You're cleaning, too?

00:20:12.080 --> 00:20:13.410
Of course.

00:20:13.410 --> 00:20:15.060
It'll go faster with three of us.

00:20:15.530 --> 00:20:18.270
With just you two, you won't 
finish in time for the next class.

00:20:18.520 --> 00:20:20.460
W-We're sorry.

00:20:20.890 --> 00:20:22.990
As long as you understand.

00:20:23.270 --> 00:20:25.150
<i>That's our vice president.</i>

00:20:31.410 --> 00:20:34.980
<i>The one activity I'm worst at, 
in the one class I'm worst at...</i>

00:20:35.960 --> 00:20:37.630
You can do it, Suzu.

00:20:38.150 --> 00:20:40.320
<i>So many people are already finished.</i>

00:20:42.540 --> 00:20:44.000
Tanahashi-san's dying out there.

00:20:44.000 --> 00:20:45.340
She's two laps behind.

00:20:46.250 --> 00:20:48.680
<i>I'm so embarrassed.</i>

00:20:50.310 --> 00:20:52.980
<i>R-Riko-senpai's watching?</i>

00:20:53.360 --> 00:20:55.640
<i>When I look so pathetic?</i>

00:20:57.420 --> 00:21:02.340
<i>"You can do it?"</i>

00:21:04.470 --> 00:21:07.270
<b>Second Lap</b>

00:21:09.750 --> 00:21:11.500
<i>They made her stand up!</i>

00:21:14.180 --> 00:21:15.550
Riko-senpai.

00:21:15.550 --> 00:21:17.500
Hey, Suzu. What's up?

00:21:18.140 --> 00:21:20.590
Um, earlier...

00:21:21.640 --> 00:21:23.870
Yeah, you were really slow.

00:21:23.870 --> 00:21:27.880
Yes. I'm sorry you had 
to stand because of me.

00:21:27.880 --> 00:21:28.780
Huh?

00:21:28.780 --> 00:21:31.130
That wasn't your fault.

00:21:31.290 --> 00:21:33.310
I really hate math.

00:21:33.310 --> 00:21:35.660
I always get in trouble 
for not paying attention.

00:21:35.860 --> 00:21:37.450
Good for you, though.

00:21:37.450 --> 00:21:38.100
Huh?

00:21:38.340 --> 00:21:40.520
You hate running more than anything, right?

00:21:40.960 --> 00:21:43.270
But you did your best out there.

00:21:43.780 --> 00:21:46.010
It was cute seeing you pant like that.

00:21:46.010 --> 00:21:47.330
Here's your reward.

00:21:50.900 --> 00:21:52.530
Okay.

00:21:53.890 --> 00:21:56.790
<i>I'm not very good at running, but...</i>

00:21:57.060 --> 00:21:58.060
<b>Growl</b>

00:22:00.080 --> 00:22:01.840
Would you like some candy?

00:22:02.180 --> 00:22:06.380
<i>But, when I'm heading 
towards those doors,</i>

00:22:07.430 --> 00:22:09.400
<i>I don't mind it at all.</i>

00:22:12.000 --> 00:22:13.350
Sorry I'm late.

00:22:17.660 --> 00:22:20.560
Okay, grit your teeth.

00:22:20.880 --> 00:22:22.120
Don't!

00:22:22.120 --> 00:22:23.880
What are you, a demon?!

00:23:57.560 --> 00:24:03.360
<b>Preview</b>

00:23:59.330 --> 00:24:01.160
<i>Now that we're through 
with our short stories,</i>

00:24:01.160 --> 00:24:02.890
<i>the next episode will kick 
off a new development!</i>

00:24:02.890 --> 00:24:05.600
<i>The Love Lab will face a new situation!</i>

00:24:05.600 --> 00:24:07.500
<i>Who will make it to the end alive?</i>

00:24:07.500 --> 00:24:09.130
<i>Just what kind of situation are we facing?</i>

00:24:09.130 --> 00:24:10.490
<i>That's wonderful!</i>

00:24:10.490 --> 00:24:13.430
<i>Fate brings a boy and girl together 
as enemies on the battlefield,</i>

00:24:13.430 --> 00:24:15.760
<i>and they're drawn to each 
other even as they fight!</i>

00:24:15.760 --> 00:24:18.820
<i>You don't have to create 
a scenario on the spot.</i>

00:24:18.820 --> 00:24:20.390
<i>Love is war.</i>

00:24:21.000 --> 00:24:27.140
<b>Love Lab?</b>

00:24:21.100 --> 00:24:24.840
<i>It pisses me off how you look like 
you think you said something clever.</i>

00:24:27.150 --> 00:24:30.140
<b>Don't miss the next episode!</b>
